          "url": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/use-nvidia-nemo-to-turn-agent-failures-into-tests-and-harness-fixes/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "codeql",
      "title": "CodeQL 2.27.4 防止打包跟随符号链接越出根目录",
      "titleId": "codeql-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "CodeQL 在 bundle 与 publish 打包时检查符号链接解析后的路径，跳过包根目录之外的文件并发出警告，也修复机器可读输出被 JVM 消息污染的问题。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "升级时还需留意 JavaScript/TypeScript 提取器不再支持 SEMMLE_TYPESCRIPT_HOME，统一使用内置编译器。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-02",
